        "raw": "I love how this game lets you imagine what's happening in the fight while you are playing.\n\nLast night I had perhaps the coolest game I've ever played. (right up there with Blade getting eaten by a T-Rex).\n\nIt was Ra, Expat, and Haka up against Plague Rat at Insula Primalis.\n\nDue to certain circumstances, Ra and Expat both got ded, with Haka at 1 HP. Haka had all 3 dominions, Mere, and Ta Moko. the environment was 2 obsidian fields. \n\nAfter the other 2 died, the fight devolved to Haka and Plague Rat just going at it, whaling on each other with no regard for their own safety. With Ra and Expat both giving Haka an extra power, he got to use Mere 3 times a round, so with that and the 3 dominions he was drawing about 7 cards a round. Whenever he got low on HP he'd just pop a Haka of Restoration, drop about 12 cards, and keep fighting. He'd Ground Pound every now and then, but it was mostly them just hitting each other repeatedly. \n\nI imagine it as Haka going into a Berserker Fury after seeing his friends injured, and completely disregarding anything that wasn't directly related to making Plague Rat hurt as much as possible. Occasionally he'd get attacked by a T-Rex, but he just shrugged it off and let Ra take care of it.\n\nIt was pretty cool.",
