        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-04T21:43:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The comic book that unfolds in your head is, from what I can tell so far, one of the more awesome things about this.<br>\nWhen playing Ra on Wagner Mars Base and the Staff of Ra comes into play, I imagine the Staff just appearing as a glint in the sky at first and then raising a red dust cloud as it smashes into a nearby rock formation.<br>\nAnd then Ra picks it up and kicks ass with it.</p>",
