        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/alex/{size}/2059_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-10T01:57:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Once, Megalopolis had out Police Backup and Cramped Quarters Combat. With all damage converted to melee, we liked to imagine there was just a couple of police stepping up to punch the Matriarch every so often. Best of all, they were the ones to deal the final blow! I always love it when the Environment finishes off a villain. It’s a much funner story that way.</p>",
