        "cooked": "<p>I’ve done the Take Down + Pillars of Hercules trick. It was glorious.<br>\nLater in that same fight, I had used Ground Pound, so they couldn’t do damage, but with the Pillars and 2 informants out, there were lots of villain cards being played.</p>",
